g that  you had experienced in your career do  you feel like that times have changed  since Ruth has come along yeah I think  um I think what I was able to channel  through Ruth was that feeling of being  in the minority of going off on film  sets and often being one of a few women  on  set so I definitely understood what it  feels like to be a bit of an outsider as  she felt in those in those moments  tell us about shooting in our beloved  Canadian city of Montreal oh we love  Montreal we absolutely adored it we just  spent all that time obviously when we  weren't working going out for dinners  the food is fantastic um I have a really  good friend good old friend he lives  there so we'd often find ourselves going  to ballet classes and things like that  but it's a wonderful wonderful city
 

